          "text": "Vertigo and dizziness history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Sudden-onset room-spinning vertigo began approximately 12 days ago and was worse with head movement, with nausea and vomiting. The patient reports marked improvement compared with the previous week and no further vomiting. Brief dizziness persists with quick head turns and when getting out of bed."
      }
    },
